UID:260728twjsdcgls0GygVgW9gjcmQ
DESCRIPTION:**Art Nite / Noche del Arte Healdsburg Returns August 6 with 
 “Music and Mocktails”**\n\nHealdsburg Comes Alive with Art\, Live Perf
 ormances\, and Creative Sips\n\nHealdsburg\, CA — On Thursday\, August 6
 \, Healdsburg’s monthly Art Nite returns from 5–7 p.m. with this month
 's theme: Music and Mocktails!Downtown galleries\, venues\, and pop-ups wi
 ll open their doors for an evening of art\, community\, and celebration. L
 ocal shops\, wineries\, and restaurants will offer special perks throughou
 t the evening\, showcasing Healdsburg’s creative spirit. Art Nite is a f
 ree\, first-Thursday tradition in Healdsburg running from April through De
 cember.\n\nThis month’s event will spotlight an exciting lineup of perfo
 rming artists\, including:Marcos Pereda\, John Youngblood\, Troubleshootin
 '\, Olive Munden\, Brazilian Jazz (Jobim)\, Flute Fusion Duo\, and The Mag
 nolias.Guests can also enjoy handcrafted mocktails provided by Land and Lo
 cal\, adding a fresh and festive touch to the art-filled stroll through to
 wn.\n\nArt Nite Healdsburg is proudly sponsored by Stay Healdsburg\, the H
 ealdsburg Chamber of Commerce\, and Kalderra.August 6 promises to be a vib
 rant\, creative\, and unforgettable summer night in downtown Healdsburg. W
 hether you come for the galleries\, the performances\, the drinks\, or the
  community atmosphere\, Art Nite is the perfect way to celebrate local cul
 ture.\n\nEvent Details:\n\nWhat: Art Nite Healdsburg — “Music and Mock
 tails” \n\nWhen: Thursday\, August 6\, 2026\, from 5–7 p.m. \n\nWher
 e: Downtown Healdsburg galleries\, venues\, restaurants\, and shops \n\nA
 dmission: Free  -\n\nFeaturing: Performing artists\, visual arts\, and La
 nd and Local mocktails\n\nAttendees can pick up a map at any participating
  venue and collect passport stamps to enjoy perks at local restaurants. Fo
 r additional information\, please visit https://www.artnitehealdsburg.com
 .
LOCATION:Downtown Healdsburg Galleries\, Shops and Restaurants
URL:https://www.artnitehealdsburg.com/about-3
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
