 ool supplies! Free swag from publishers! Permanent Jewelry Pop-up with Chr
 istina May from Star-Crossed Bonded Jewelry RSVP BY AUGUST 4! Attendees ar
 e allowed one plus 1. RSVPs cannot be for more than 2 people. RSVPs capped
  at 50—plus 1s are included in that number. Attendees must be full-time 
