BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:An Evening with Chuck Matto
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260806T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260806T180000
UID:260805OFQqcuJpaky5kXtyrFOPDA
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a special event at PLAYTE Kitchen with Chuck Matto
 \, author of Chuck's Flavor Train. Tickets start at $15.00. ABOUT THE BOOK
  "Hop on board the Flavor Train with Bay Area Barbecue Bad A$$\, Chuck Mat
 to\, as he takes you on a wild ride of high energy and flavor-first barbec
 ue that will keep your friends and family coming back." — Guy Fieri “C
 hucks Flavor Train is a cookbook for those who want more than just instruc
 tions. It’s for anyone ready to trust their gut\, break a few 'rules\,' 
 embrace imperfection\, and cook with intention.” — Emeril Lagasse All 
 aboard Chuck’s Flavor Train as social media BBQ sensation Chuck Matto br
 ings his bold\, high-energy cooking style to the page. With 75 mouthwateri
 ng recipes that showcase Chuck’s signature flavor-packed approach to gri
 lling\, this cookbook takes barbecue to the next level. From perfectly smo
 ked brisket and fall-off-the-bone ribs to crispy\, juicy chicken and next-
 level grilled seafood\, Chuck shares his trusted techniques\, secret spice
  blends\, and innovative marinades that guarantee incredible flavor every 
 time. PERFECT FOR ALL COOKS: Includes a comprehensive barbecue guide with 
 tips and how to\, like how to bring ease to your grilling experience\, mar
 inade for maximum flavor\, or get that perfect sear\, all from viral BBQ C
 ook Chuck Matto SPECIAL SPICE SECRETS: Flavor is essential on this train! 
 With Chuck’s game-changing spice blends that are sure to fire up any dis
 h\, you will never be left with a bland or lackluster spread again GREAT G
 IFT IDEA: This ticket to smokin’ hot barbecue is a perfect gift for the 
 grill master in your life—ideal for Father’s Day or any grilling gathe
 ring ABOUT THE AUTHOR Chuck Matto is the fire-loving\, flavor-obsessed pit
 master behind Chuck’s Flavor Train\, a social media sensation known for 
 its bold barbecue\, high-energy cooking\, and next-level flavor “bombs
 ”. With a massive following on TikTok and Instagram\, Chuck has built a 
 loyal fanbase by sharing juicy\, smoky\, and mouthwatering recipes\, along
  with expert grilling techniques and pro tips that make barbecuing accessi
 ble to all. Chuck has made a name for himself on television\, appearing on
  Food Network’s BBQ Brawl and other culinary competitions\, which showca
 sed his passion for live-fire cooking and bold flavors. A true self-taught
  barbecue innovator\, Chuck is here to help home cooks and backyard pitmas
 ters crank up the heat\, amp up the flavor\, and turn every meal into a go
 od time. Find him on Instagram and TikTok: @chucksflavortrain PLAYTE KITCH
 EN BIO: PLAYTE Kitchen is a hands-on cooking school and culinary experienc
 e destination in the heart of Napa Valley where food becomes the social in
 gredient that brings people together. At PLAYTE\, cooking is about more th
 an making great meals—it's about building confidence\, creating memories
 \, and connecting with others around the table. Designed for home chefs of
  every skill level\, classes focus on real-life cooking using ingredients 
 you can find\, equipment you can actually use\, and techniques you'll use 
 again and again. Whether you're joining a public cooking class\, celebrati
 ng with friends\, bringing your team together for a corporate event\, or t
 raveling the world with us through immersive culinary adventures\, every P
 LAYTE experience is built around curiosity\, learning\, and connection. Pa
 rt kitchen\, part classroom\, part event space\, and part creative studio\
 , PLAYTE teach the "why" behind every technique so you leave with more tha
 n a recipe—you leave with the confidence to recreate it at home and the 
 stories that come from sharing it with others.
LOCATION:PLAYTE Kitchen
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/2280589472344899/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
