 he Pavilion at FARM\, an al fresco lounge with fire pits\, cozy seating\, 
 and lush culinary gardens—this is the perfect way to gather with friends
 \, discover new music\, and savor a Napa Valley evening under the golden h
 our sky.          Visit WebsiteEvent Tickets
