 ess European tradition that Dan Kosta discovered during his early restaura
 nt years\, First Fridays at Convene invite you to slow down\, savor the mo
 ment\, and reconnect over exceptional wine and food.\n\nFrom 5–7 PM on t
 he first Friday of every month\, we'll be pouring a curated selection of C
 onvene wines alongside one of the world's finest indulgences: Tsar Nicoula
 i Osetra Caviar\, thoughtfully served with crisp potato chips\, Bellwether
