 r a night of explosive sound\, blending disco-punk\, electro-funk\, post-p
 unk\, and industrial synth energy into one unforgettable live experience. 
 The Crooked Stuff brings existential discopunk for the people - a driving 
 mix of post-punk urgency\, abrasive electronics\, and danceable synth groo
 ves shaped by influences from D.C. hardcore\, Bay Area psychedelia\, funk\
 , and industrial music. Fresh off radio play across the country and perfor
 mances at Sundance Film Festival\, the trio continues building momentum ah
 ead of their upcoming album Synthetic Signals.  TheCrookedStuff.com Space 
 Suit fuses big-beat hip-hop\, funk grooves\, guitars\, and layered vocals 
