BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Katie Phillips\, Karen Joy Brown and Little Door @ The Lost Church
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260807T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260807T230000
UID:260719fLQWVaDgUkC---B4SSppPw
DESCRIPTION:Songwriters in the round with indie/folk/singer songwriters\n\
 n**Karen Joy Brown** Karen Joy Brown's elegantly sparse pop/Americana guit
 ar and deeply soulful voice disarm listeners with raw emotional honesty th
 at inspires reflection and connection. Literate lyrics reveal a poet's sou
 l with a singular sense of rhythm\, humor and compassion that leaves liste
 ners feeling uplifted and finally understood. www.karenjoybrown.com www.in
 stagram.com/karenjoybrowncreates\n\n**Katie Phillips** Singer-songwriter w
 ith a voice that stops you in your tracks and songs that stick in your rib
 cage long after the last note fades. Recognized for her extraordinary voca
 l gift since childhood\, Katie carries her father's words close: that one 
 of life's greatest honors would be using her voice as sacred offering to t
 hose she loves. Drawing from a kaleidoscope of influences\, Katie crafts v
 isceral songwriting that creates narrative universes you immediately inhab
 it. With virtuosic melodies and high craft\, she plunges you into her most
  vulnerable worries\, pains\, and tender loves\, each song startlingly int
 imate and specific. www.instagram.com/katiepsingsasong\n\n**little door** 
 begins with a simple idea: each person is a portal into deep consciousness
 \, and music is one way to open that door — or leave it ajar. Rooted in 
 psych-folk and cosmic groove\, her acoustic performances draw on themes of
  awakening\, motherhood\, love\, and the tender\, unspoken corners of the 
 psyche. Unhurried and embodied\, her live sets are the kind you feel as mu
 ch as hear — an invitation to arrive fully in yourself. www.littledoormu
 sic.com www.instagram.com/littledoor.music\n\nRecommended If You Like: *F
 iona Apple\, Annie Lennox\, Brandie Carlile\, Jenny Lewis\, CMAT\, Lana De
 l Rey\, Waxahatchee\, Mazzy Star\, Lucinda Williams*\n\n*Earlybirds!*\n\n*
 **$3 off each ticket*** *when you use the code* **earlybird5** *at check
 out. Offer ends August 2nd.*\n\n*Promo Codes are not applicable at the 
 door.*\n\n*Codes are not case sensitive\, but must be typed as one word.*
LOCATION:The Lost Church
URL:https://tinyurl.com/PhillipsJoyBrownlittledoor
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
