UID:2607110LYJ0QHadEaSDQeJP3nHjg
DESCRIPTION:This is not your Nonna’s party: Whitehall Lane will host an 
 Italian-inspired afternoon of wine\, food\, and live music during Under th
 e Valley Sun on August 8 in their Garden Pavilion. The alfresco lunch cha
 nnels the relaxed spirit of the Tuscan countryside with Italian fare\, a l
 ive DJ and an open wine bar pouring Whitehall Lane wines. Tickets are avai
 lable for $125 per person\, and $100 for club members. \n\nDress code: W
 hat would you wear on vacation in Tuscany? Perhaps casual and chic linen
 \, or maybe something bolder and ready to dance among the vines. \n\nKe
 ep in mind\, this event is outdoors\, so please dress according to the wea
 ther.
