DESCRIPTION:Jacobethan Theatre Workshop presents Caesar\, a free\, modern-
 dress production of Shakespeare’s political tragedy and the fourth seaso
 n of Shakespeare in the Park\\(ing Lot\\).\n\nRunning approximately 95 min
 utes without intermission\, Caesar follows the conspiracy against Julius C
 aesar\, the ensuing assassination\, and the political collapse unleashed b
 y men who believe they are saving the republic.\n\nAt Sonoma Community Cen
 ter\, performances take place outdoors on Saturday\, August 8\, at 7:30 p.
 m. and on Sunday\, August 9\, at 3:00 p.m.\n\nAdmission is free. Advance s
 eat reservations are encouraged.\n\nThis touring production also appears a
 t 6th Street Playhouse in Santa Rosa and Life On Art in Petaluma.
