DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260808T213000
UID:260625PDPk6oYrHkGaCtj_4KaM7g
DESCRIPTION:A new play by G.B. Lindsay.\n\nOld friends\, Jaycoen (Stephen 
 K Patterson) and Ougein (GB Lindsay) wake up to another delightful day at 
 the beach as ocean sings and war rages on. But Today enters like no other 
 Yesterday\, for this day has arrived with new twisted turns and burns\, tu
 cked-up into its sun-worn sleeves. Enter six extraordinary beings (mostly 
 Taylor Diffenderfer) who will test the limits of their friendship and the 
 inevitability of their fate.\n\nBeached is an absurdist tragicomedy in the
  tradition of Laurel and Hardy\, Beckett\, Kafka\, Tom Stoppard\, and Eric
  Overmyer.
LOCATION:The Imaginists
URL:https://theimaginists.org/beached-julyaug
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
