SUMMARY:Central Santa Rosa Book Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260811T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260811T190000
UID:260722o7DGABBOMEqDYuHjPFbBWg
DESCRIPTION:Join us on the second Tuesday of each month at 6:00 PM as we d
 iscuss a different contemporary novel or nonfiction work. Print copies are
  available in the branch. Feel free to call the library or email  central@
 sonomalibrary.org with any questions. Book Club titles and dates are subje
 ct to change. For up to date information visit: sonomalibrary.org/bookclub
