SUMMARY:Gamble Estates Sauvignon Blanc Experience
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260812T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260812T140000
UID:260720SZmMmfugnECO_4kVFvZ-zQ
DESCRIPTION:Seasonal Offering Through September 2026\n\nExplore a new dime
 nsion of Napa Valley Sauvignon Blanc through this seasonal tasting experie
 nce. Begin with a glass of the 2025 Yountville Sauvignon Blanc as you’re
  guided through the cellar\, exploring the cigar\, puncheon\, and barrique
  barrels used in our Reserve program.\n\nThen\, take a seat in our vineyar
 d‑facing salon for a guided exploration of the 2023\, 2024\, and 2025 Yo
 untville Sauvignon Blanc. Your tasting will conclude with our Reserve Sauv
 ignon Blanc\, offering a deeper look at the craft and progression behind t
 his signature wine.\n\n*Tasting fees are applied toward wine purchases.*
