  racing\, exhibits\, local food\, games\, and the beloved Hall of Flowers 
 during this annual summer tradition. Fair hours begin at noon weekdays and
  10 AM on Fridays\, Saturdays\, and Sundays. Gates close at 9 PM daily\, w
 ith fair activities continuing until 10 PM Tuesday-Thursday and 11 PM Frid
