DESCRIPTION:Join us for a magical evening as the summer light softens in t
 he Meditation Garden. Osmosis welcomes Rumi’s Caravan\, a beloved Califo
 rnia ensemble dedicated to restoring the soul of the world through the liv
 ing tradition of poetry.  \n\nFor more than 25 years\, Rumi’s Caravan h
 as captivated audiences with transformative spoken word performances\, wea
 ving together the timeless wisdom of poets\, mystics\, and storytellers in
  a way that inspires reflection\, connection\, and wonder. \n\nYour ticket
  includes: \n\n Wine and cheese reception with Black Kite\n\n Cedar Enzyme
  Footbath\n\n Live performance by Rumi’s Caravan\n\n Access to the Medit
 ation Garden and Osmosis grounds \n\nReserve your spot now!
URL:https://osmosis.com/event/rumis-caravan-2026/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
