DESCRIPTION:Don’t be fooled by the title of this play – it’s a comed
 y!\n\nIvan Menchell’s The Cemetery Club is a bittersweet comedy about th
 ree Jewish widows in Queens\, New York\, who meet monthly to visit their h
 usbands' graves. Their routine is upended when one of them  begins dating
  a widower\, who\, they incidentally\, meet at the cemetery. The ensuing d
 rama tests their loyalties\, offering a poignant look at love\, friendship
  and moving on.
LOCATION:Bay Area Stage Theatre on Broadway
URL:https://www.bayareastage.org/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
