SUMMARY:Friday Night Comedy - Allison Hooker - Downtown Santa Rosa
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260814T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260814T210000
UID:260715UDT9sV6vPEa19yXuQ2sqmA
DESCRIPTION:Friday night stand-up comedy in Downtown Santa Rosa\n\nVIP TAB
 LES NOW AVAILABLE! Snag a table for 4 with preferred seating\, your own pr
 ivate call button to summon service\, and your first round of beer/cider (
 or a bottle of wine) for only $95!\n\nEvery Friday night hilarious comedia
 ns from The Bay Area and beyond perform at Barrel Proof Lounge. Stick arou
 nd after for late-night karaoke! Fresh lineup of funny each Friday.\n\nThi
 s Week: Casey Williams (host) Damian Montes Headliner: Allison Hooker\n\nA
 llison Hooker is a San Francisco based comedian and writer who regularly p
 erforms in the underground scene as well as prominent clubs such as Punch 
 Line and Cobb’s Comedy Club . She is a member of **#hellafunny** crew\, 
 produces and runs multiple weekly shows in San Francisco\, is the winner o
 f the Heavy Weight Comedy Competition at Sacramento Punch Line and once op
 ened for a guy who once opened for Dave Chapelle .\n\n21+ Doors - 7p / Sho
 w - 8p $15adv / $20door\n\nCheck out **www.BarrelProofLounge.com** for all
  sorts of good times ahead.
LOCATION:Barrel Proof Lounge
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/friday-night-comedy-allison-hooker-downto
 wn-santa-rosa-tickets-1990353354462?aff=oddtdtcreator
