DESCRIPTION:Based in the Napa Valley\, the Silverado Handweavers and Spinn
 ers Guild brings together people who share a love for fiber arts and creat
 ive expression.  This Artwalk exhibit celebrates the art and craft of spi
 nning\, dyeing\, weaving and tapestry to transform fiber into something be
 autiful\, useful and entirely handmade. Guild members who contributed to t
 his exhibit include: Sharon Crary\, Kim Farmer\, Anne Gomes\, Peggy Gorbac
 h\, Joan Harris\, Justyn Hegreberg\, Jody Lane\, Kate McBride\, Linda Nell
 et\, Mary Ann Parker\, Christy Redford\, and Susan Robinson.
