DESCRIPTION:Register for up to 3 hours to DIY-digitize your audiovisual me
 dia \\(VHS and audiocassette tapes\\). Appointments are available by reser
 vation only Thursdays\, Fridays\, and Saturdays\, starting promptly at 1pm
 . Limited to 1 station per day\, 1 appointment per week\, per library card
  holder. The Memory Lab user who books the lab appointment must have a Son
 oma County Library general card account\, be age 18 or older\, and read an
 d agree to the User Agreement below. By clicking "Register" on this event\
 , the Lab User agrees to follow the terms and conditions in the User Agree
