BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Dog Days of Summer Cover Fest
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260815T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260815T163000
UID:260728Vwj37VhiKEa6f8s1FAHDqw
DESCRIPTION:Dog Days of Summer Cover Fest\n\nHook & Ladder's Dog Days of S
 ummer Cover Fest brings an afternoon of reimagined music to the vineyard\,
  with two North Bay acts and a feel-good reason to raise a glass.\n\n🍷 
 **Wine Club Perk:** Up to 4 member guests receive a complimentary glass of
  Chill Red or Estate Sauvignon Blanc on arrival.\n\n**1:00–2:00 pm | SPF
 1985** Local Sonoma County surf rock favorites kick things off with their 
 signature high-energy sound.\n\n**2:30–4:30 pm | Jazz Mafia w/ Otis McDo
 nald: Beatles Reimagined** Led by multi-instrumentalist and vocalist Otis 
 McDonald\, Jazz Mafia reframes the Beatles' legendary catalog with fresh g
 rooves\, inventive arrangements\, and unexpected musical backdrops — fol
 lowing their acclaimed sold-out Bay Area runs.\n\n**Giving Back:** 20% of 
 all wine sales will be donated to First Responder Therapy Dogs — support
 ing the dogs and handlers who serve those who serve us.\n\n**What to Know:
