BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Pranzo di Ferragosto
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260815T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260815T160000
UID:260720FN0G7FiVK02RgNCw-GwSZA
DESCRIPTION:An Afternoon Italian Style – Celebrating Italian Culture wit
 h Family and Friends Benefiting the NBICF Scholarship Fund\n\nJoin us for
  Pranzo di Ferragosto at D'Argenzio Winery as we celebrate one of Italy'
 s most beloved summer traditions. Gather with family and friends on the pa
 tio for a memorable afternoon featuring a delicious five-course meal of an
 tipasti\, salad\, pasta\, sausage\, and dessert. Wine and other beverages 
 will be available for purchase.\n\nIn Italy\, Ferragosto\, celebrated eac
 h year on August 15\, is one of the country's most cherished holidays. Lon
 g communal tables fill town squares and streets as families and friends co
 me together to enjoy abundant food\, great conversation\, and the joy of b
 eing together. Rooted in both ancient Roman and religious traditions\, Fer
 ragosto has become a nationwide celebration of summer\, community\, and It
 alian hospitality.\n\nWe'll bring that same spirit to Sonoma Wine Country
 —with our own special traditions. Enjoy a friendly bocce ball tournament
  \\(whether you play or simply cheer from the sidelines\\)\, browse our si
 lent auction\, and bid on wonderful prizes while supporting the NBICF Scho
 larship Fund. Every bid helps preserve and promote Italian heritage\, cult
 ure\, and language for future generations.\n\nYou'll also have the opportu
 nity to meet some of our scholarship recipients\, hear inspiring family st
 ories\, and enjoy live entertainment with Carlo Solivan as we celebrate th
 e rich traditions that connect us all.\n\nCome hungry\, bring your friends
  and family\, and join us for an unforgettable afternoon of Italian food\,
  music\, laughter\, and community.
LOCATION:D'Argenzio Winery
URL:https://nbicf.getcommunal.com/parent_programs/3976
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Equality Vines Wine & Donate Benefiting Sonoma Family Meal
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260815T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260815T190000
UID:260719JDoy-RBXMEyx5JVBpoaWGQ
DESCRIPTION:Equality Vines Wine & Donate Benefiting SFM A Summer Gathering
  for Good\n\nSaturday\, August 15 | 4-7pm Equality Vines\, Guerneville\n\n
 Join us this summer for a relaxed afternoon of wine\, food\, and community
  with Equality Vines and Sonoma Family Meal - non-ticketed and open to all
  - in support of expanding food security and tuition-free culinary trainin
 g programs in Sonoma County.\n\nSip with a purpose as Equality Vines donat
 es 15% of all wine sales\, plus $5 for every bottle of Familia Tempranillo
  sold\, to Sonoma Family Meal. SFM's SABOR food truck will be onsite servi
 ng up fresh\, globally-inspired food for purchase\, and guests can enjoy o
 pportunities to learn about Sonoma Family Meal’s work\, participate in a
  raffle\, and connect over a shared commitment to community.\n\nCome sip\,
  savor\, and support - And see how doing good can taste good too!\n\nSonom
 a Family Meal is a local nonprofit employment social enterprise that has w
 orked to nourish the community and strengthen the local food ecosystem sin
 ce the tragic 2017 wildfires that left many people displaced and food-inse
 cure. Today\, our two kitchens provide over 7\,000 meals to those in need 
 each month\, while addressing food insecurity at the root through tuition-
 free culinary training programs that create opportunity and economic empow
 erment for low-income individuals facing barriers to employment or access 
 to education.
LOCATION:Equality Vines Tasting Room
URL:https://www.sonomafamilymeal.org/wineanddonate
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
