DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260815T153000
UID:260508OIh8LaA87EysyMVHTgDOPA
DESCRIPTION:Bricoleur Vineyards’ beloved Essentials Picnic pairs a b
 ottle of wine with charcuterie\, presented in a quintessential wicker bask
 et and a chic red wagon\, offering a relaxed and beautifully curated alfre
 sco wine country experience. Guests can enjoy their picnic in picturesque\
 , family- and dog-friendly settings across the estate—whether on the Pav
 ilion lawn\, beneath the trellis by the pond\, or at the picnic tables nes
 tled within the culinary and rose gardens. With exceptional wines\, thou
 ghtfully crafted foods\, and sweeping vistas\, a visit to Bricoleur Vin
 eyards offers a laid-back\, family-friendly atmosphere featuring lawn ga
 mes\, board games\, scavenger hunts\, and catch-and-release fishing.
LOCATION:Bricoleur Vineyard
URL:https://bricoleurvineyards.com/pages/visit?srsltid=AfmBOoq4MRc2MHal1tH
