BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Gravity Vault Marin's 5th Anniversary Party
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260816T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260816T150000
UID:2608034vTbzVk9XUqcnA2QZAgzuQ
DESCRIPTION:**The Gravity Vault Marin is celebrating its 5th Birthday\,
  and you're invited!**\n\nCelebrate our 5th Anniversary with an unforgett
 able weekend of excitement! Enjoy thrilling activities like try-a-climb wi
 th our expert staff\, engaging competitions for all levels\, and delicious
  treats from our food truck\\*. Explore our vendor village\, grab exclusiv
 e membership & retail deals\, and win fantastic prizes!\n\nWhether you're 
 a seasoned climber\, just starting out\, or curious - there's something 
 for everyone. All are welcome!\n\n**And the best part? Day passes are ONLY
  $10!**\n\n\\*Food not included in admission price.\n\n**Be sure to fill o
 ut your waivers ahead of time!**\n\n**ANNIVERSARY PARTY SCHEDULE**\n\n**
 Saturday August 15th & Sunday August 16th: 10am - 3pm**\n\n*$10 Admission*
 \n\n*Try-A-Climb for All Ages (5+)*\n\n*Raffles & Prizes*\n\n*Membership S
 pecials*\n\n*20% Off Retail*\n\n*Food Truck: Sabor A Rancho*\n\n**Climbin
 g Competitions and Challenges: Saturday & Sunday**\n\nSeize the opportun
 ity to score amazing prizes from top brands! No pre-registration required 
 for Speed Climbing and Routesetter's Challenge—just come\, climb\, and s
 howcase your phenomenal skills! Open to climbers aged 5 and up and any lev
 el of climbing ability. Separate speed climbing routes for kids and adults
  ensure everyone has a chance to shine! Kilter Board comp is for ages 14+
  and **registration** is required.\n\n*Speed Climbing: 10 - 12pm Saturday
  and Sunday*\n\n*Kilter Board Comp: 12 - 2pm* ***Saturday Only |*** *Ages 
 14+ |* ***Registration*** *Required* \n\n*Routesetter's Challenge: 1 - 3p
 m Saturday and Sunday*\n\nHuge thank you to our prize sponsors: Metolius\,
  Unparallel\, Black Diamond\, Friction Labs\, Sterling Rope\, Drag Me Up T
 he Wall\, V12 Resole\, Supercarb & more!\n\n**Complimentary Workshop: Su
 nday 11am - 12pm**\n\nWant a great introduction to climbing outside? Joi
 n us for a FREE Intro to Outdoor Sport Climbing Workshop with Coach Niko
 lai (AMGA SPI). In this intro session\, you’ll be exposed to:\n\nHow to 
 identify common hardware at bolted anchors\n\nHow anchors are built and c
 leaned\n\nSome of the different skills used for single-pitch sport climbin
 g\n\nIf you're just starting to explore outdoor climbing\, this is a this
  is great workshop to learn from a certified guide and experienced coach! 
 Ages 14+. Please note this is an introductory workshop\, and when transit
 ioning outside\, we recommend you go with certified guides.\n\n**Community
  & Vendor Village: Saturday 10am - 3pm**\n\nDiscover the vibrant climbin
 g community at Gravity Vault Marin and beyond! Join us to learn more abou
 t our amazing partners and local businesses. The Community Village will b
 e bustling with activities and exclusive offers. Come by to connect with f
 ellow climbers\, try out new gear\, and take advantage of special deals.\n
 \n*V12 Resole*\n\n*Tonali Labs*\n\n*Queer Crush*\n\n*Drag Me up the Wall*\
 n\n*Supercarb - Hitesh Manglani*\n\n*Unparallel Shoe Demo \\[11:30am - 2:
 30pm\\]*\n\n*True Method Massage \\[also tabling Sunday\, 10am - 3pm\\]*\n
 \n**Gravity Vault Climbing Team & Kids' Classes: Saturday & Sunday 10am 
 - 3pm**\n\nDiscover more about our exciting kids’ programs by meeting 
 our coaches and Director of Climbing Teams & Youth Programs daily. Get a
 ll your questions answered and enroll your kids in the perfect program for
  them! \n\n**We can't wait to celebrate our 5th Birthday with you!**
LOCATION:Gravity Vault Marin
URL:https://tinyurl.com/GVM-5THANNIV
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
