UID:260804NUkUkHqpp0enMwHnqXEV8Q
DESCRIPTION:“….Get ready for the super-entertaining sounds of local ba
 nd The Social Contractors. They totally rock\, in all the right ways…”
  - Argus-Courier\n\nJoin us at one of our favorite venues as we celebrate 
 our 50th show! Since our summer launch in 2023\, The Social Contractors ha
 ve performed 49 times at various venues in Sonoma County. August 16th will
  be our 50th public venue event and we're thrilled to celebrate with a fre
 e show at Lagunitas Tap Room in Petaluma!\n\nWe'll be in full four-piece f
 orm\, featuring Jason E. Davies (lead vocals/lead guitar)\, Travis Thayer 
 (sax/keys/vocals)\, Rob Neidel (bass/vocals)\, and Chris Oatman (drums)\, 
 and will be performing our "greatest hits' – including our best original
  rock tunes and our own spin on popular hits from some of our favorite ban
 ds from the 60s-90s (Beatles\, Doors\, CCR\, Hendrix\, Pink Floyd\, Stevie
  Wonder\, Steve Miller\, Police\, Men At Work\, Tears For Fears\, Tom Pett
 y\, Steely Dan\, U2\, and more)!\n\nWhether you like melodic vocals\, sear
 ing guitar and sax solos\, intriguing lyrics\, captivating songs\, or just
  great dynamic and danceable rhythms\, The Social Contractors won't disapp
 oint!\n\nWith a large outdoor stage and great free live music\, a full men
 u of delicious food and beverages to choose from\, plenty of indoor and ou
 tdoor seating\, and an open outdoor dance floor\, Lagunitas Tap Room and B
 eer Sanctuary is THE place to be on Sunday August 16th!
LOCATION:Lagunitas Brewing Company
URL:https://lagunitas.com/taproom/petaluma/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
