DESCRIPTION:Friday night stand-up comedy in Downtown Santa Rosa\n\nVIP TAB
 LES NOW AVAILABLE! Snag a table for 4 with preferred seating\, your own pr
 ivate call button to summon service\, and your first round of beer/cider (
 or a bottle of wine) for only $95!\n\nEvery Friday night hilarious comedia
 ns from The Bay Area and beyond perform at Barrel Proof Lounge. Stick arou
 nd after for late-night karaoke! Fresh lineup of funny each Friday.\n\nThi
 s Week: Jon Lehre (host) Jason Nathan Jalisa Robinson\n\nHeadliner: Matt G
 ubser\n\n“A true comedian…just a laid-back dude with a bone-dry wit.
 ” -San Jose Metro\n\nMatt Gubser is a San Francisco Bay Area comedian wh
 o performs across the country and internationally.\n\nDiving into parentin
 g\, dating\, sex\, politics\, & religion\, he mixes his personal life and 
 biting social commentary\, all couched in a comfortable\, relaxed delivery
 . Matt was has been part of SF Weekly's "Best of the Bay" and was named 
 “Comedian’s Comedian” in the Bay Area Stand Up Comedy Awards. You ca
 n watch his first special\, "Daddy Issues" on Next Up Comedy.\n\nHis most 
 recent album\, “Before He Was Famous\,” reached #2 on Amazon Music's c
 omedy chart.\n\nHe's opened for Amy Schumer\, Margaret Cho\, Eddie Pepiton
 e\, Aasif Mandvi\, Myq Kaplan\, Jake Johannsen among others. More at **htt
 ps://www.mattgubser.com/**\n\n21+ Doors - 7p / Show - 8p $15adv / $20door\
 n\nCheck out **www.BarrelProofLounge.com** for all sorts of good times ahe
 ad.
