BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:A Solo Show From Debra Seal - Human Landscapes Contours
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260822T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260822T190000
UID:260720Mp9jKsms3Em3pa1Gjk9HTw
DESCRIPTION:**Debra Seal’s new exhibition\, *Contours*\, invites viewers
  to encounter the human form with fresh eyes. By transforming the body int
 o abstract\, landscape-like compositions\, the work moves beyond familiar 
 social assumptions and encourages an appreciation of its raw shapes\, text
 ure\, and natural beauty. Building on the conversations prompted by her ea
 rlier exhibitions\, particularly around the representation of women\, Seal
  provokes curiosity and acceptance in place of the prejudice and the preco
 nceived notions embedded in our collective consciousness.**
LOCATION:Studio LZ
URL:https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/a-solo-show-from-debra-
 seal-human-landscapes-contours/19443242/2026-08-22T16
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
