DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260822T180000
UID:260728R8ZJ87mdtUi5WccxFT3onQ
DESCRIPTION:With Cathrina of Cat Hawk Gardens\, “The Kokedama Mama”\n\
 nDiscover the Japanese art of kokedama—living plant arrangements wrapped
  in moss. Guided by Cathrina of Cat Hawk Gardens\, you’ll explore this m
 indful practice of balance\, beauty\, and simplicity while creating your o
 wn kokedama to take home.\n\nIn this workshop you’ll:\n\n• Learn tradi
 tional techniques for forming and binding moss balls\n\n• Make your own 
 kokedama to take home\n\n• Gain skills to continue creating on your own
 \n\nAll supplies provided. Includes a grounding Self-Breema movement pract
 ice to connect body and mind.
LOCATION:Gather Sebastopol
URL:https://gathersebastopol.com/products/the-art-of-kokedama
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
