 am Tan Workshop Sunday 9AM - Noon\n\nLimited Space\n\nContact Bob Shimon\n
 \nshimon@mcn.org\n\nMEETING LOCATION\n\nGarden Room\, Rohnert Park Communi
 ty\n\nCenter\, 5401 Snyder Lane\, Rohnert Park\,\n\nCalifornia 94928\n\nBE
 GINNERS’ CLASSES\n\nREBS provides beginners classes in bonsai basics\, s
 cheduled periodically based on member and public sign ups. For a small fee
 \, students are introduced to the living art of bonsai. All materials are 
 provided and students get to keep their bonsai tree.\n\nMEMBERS’ WORKSHO
 PS\n\nREBS senior club members assist in styling\, care and maintenance of
  bonsai. These workshops are held monthly. Members work with their own bon
 sai\, tools\, wire\, and related materials. A small fee is required per wo
 rkshop.\n\nADVANCED WORKSHOPS\n\nAll advanced workshops are conducted by r
 enowned professional artists and instructors. These workshops are schedule
 d throughout the year.\n\nMEMBERSHIP\n\nFor additional information and mem
