UID:2608036muZ4T21cUuVirr-0qZr-Q
DESCRIPTION:Sundays Weekly · 8 Weeks\n\nDate & Time\n\nAugust 16 – Octo
 ber 4\, 2026\n\n11:00 AM – 2:00 PM\n\n\\*There WILL be class on Septembe
 r 6th over Labor Day Weekend\n\nLocation\n\nRoom 117\, Ceramics Studio\n\n
