BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Wendy Franklin is Sky Ranch Gallery's Featured Artist for August
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260824T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260824T140000
UID:26071642PAci7qTUaU6NCcKck8QA
DESCRIPTION:Wendy G. Franklin is a native California plein air painter wor
 king in oils and watercolor. Coastal scenes\, rivers\, country roads figur
 e prominently in her paintings.
LOCATION:Sky Ranch Gallery
URL:https://www.skyranchgallery.com
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
