DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260825T123000
UID:260805fh4e3e4MLUOR8oWdK5ZJgQ
DESCRIPTION:Students will learn to use a laptop\, internet\, basic compute
 r security\, cloud drive\, file management\, and Google suite. Use a lapto
