 oduce. It’s the vivid Dry Creek strawberries and summer peaches that ins
 pire him to create daily specials that break your regular routine. Chef Jo
 rge loves to feature artisanal melons from the Russian River Valley as soo
 n as they are ripe. This family style meal will showcase his favorites and
  the farmers. We are thrilled to share that exact joy with you. Join us fo
 r The Costeaux Community Table Series starting August 26. Come meet the fa
 rmers behind the flavors.\n\nCommunity Table Dinner | $85 per person (excl
 udes beverages and gratuities)\n\nAugust 26 Preston Parm + Winery\n\nSepte
 mber 9 Farmprenuers + Old World Winery\n\nSeptember 23 Front Porch Farms +
  Quivira
