UID:260713OuURFR1V_Eym1Ac8BEHC5g
DESCRIPTION:Directions:\n\nTo be provided only upon successful RSVP.\n\nSp
 onsor: Parks\n\nAccommodation Information: If you are a person with a disa
 bility and require an accommodation to participate in a County program\, s
 ervice\, or activity\, requests may be made by calli ng 415-473-4381 \\(Vo
 ice\\)\, Dial 711 for CA Relay\, or by submitting a\n\nDisability Accommod
 ation Request\n\nat least five business days in advance of the event. We w
 ill do our best to fulfill requests received with less than five business 
 days' notice. Copies of documents are available in alternative formats upo
 n request.\n\nJoin Ranger Gabe and the Marin Stargazers on Mount Burdell a
 nd watch the shadow of the Earth eclipse the Moon. Weather permitting\, we
 'll see a 96% lunar eclipse through telescopes. Friendly dogs are welcome 
 but mu st be leashed. Dress in layers\, wear sturdy shoes\, bring a red he
 adlam p or flashlight\, and binoculars if you have them. Be prepared for a
  0.5-mile walk on uneven ground to and from the viewing area in the dark. 
 Adverse weather or poor air quality may result in cancellation. Check the 
 calendar or call \\(415\\) 473-2816 two hours before the event to confirm 
 the status. Registration is required.\n\nQuestions: Contact\n\nGabe Ngaran
 gad
LOCATION:Mount
URL:https://www.marincounty.gov/county-marin-calendar
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
