 e a plant ferment using herbs\, weeds\, and other common garden plants\n\n
 • Learn how biodynamic compost preparations and field sprays support so
 il health\, crop vitality\, and pest resistance\n\n• Take home your own
  plant ferment\, a packet of biodynamic herbs\, and techniques to use in y
 our garden\n\nHeld at Three Springs Community Farm. No prior biodynamic ga
 rdening experience require
