BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Wonderful World of Natural Dye
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260829T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260829T180000
UID:260728OlQeM2aWIUSxvwkc2yjMnA
DESCRIPTION:Spend the day exploring the art and science of natural dyeing.
  This immersive workshop covers the complete natural dye process while int
 roducing a variety of techniques for creating beautiful\, lasting color on
  natural fibers.\n\nIn this workshop you'll:\n\n• Learn the foundations 
 of natural dyeing\, from fiber preparation to creating lasting color\n\n
 • Explore bundle dyeing\, eco-printing\, and natural color modifiers\n\n
 • Create a collection of naturally dyed samples\, silk scarves\, and an 
 eco-printed linen piece to take home\n\nAll materials included. No prior e
 xperience required
LOCATION:Gather Sebastopol
URL:https://gathersebastopol.com/products/the-wonderful-world-of-natural-d
 ye
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
