DESCRIPTION:Everyone is welcome to join us at The Kove\, a new community h
 ub for all ages of Marin County residents. Every Saturday morning\, meet a
 t The Kove to build connections and take part in programs that nourish hea
 lth\, learning and belonging\, including health & wellness talks\, connect
 ion to resources\, enrollment for our weekly food pantry\, and our Neighbo
 r Connection Hour at "Saturdays at The Kove"! The Kove is located in a wel
