DESCRIPTION:KIDS HIP HOP \, Sept 2nd – Dec 16\n\nAGES 4\,5\,6\n\nTIME 3:
 00 pm – 4:00 pm\n\nGet ready to bounce\, rock\, and roll! Our Kids Hip-H
 op class is a high-energy\, fun-filled introduction to the world of street
  dance.\n\nDesigned specifically for young dancers\, this class focuses on
  rhythm\, coordination\, and building self-confidence\, all while grooving
  to their favorite clean\, age-appropriate beats.\n\nWe break down the coo
 lest moves into simple\, easy-to-follow steps. Your child will learn the b
 asics of hip-hop foundation\, memory-boosting choreography\, and how to ex
 press their unique personality through movement.\n\n• Fun Warm-Ups: High
 -energy games and stretches to get the body moving and blood pumping.\n\n
 • Skill Building: Learning classic hip-hop grooves\, isolations\, and fo
 otwork.\n\n• The Routine: A fun\, step-by-step dance routine they can’
 t wait to show off at home!\n\n• Freestyle Circle: A supportive space at
  the end of class for kids to show off their own creative moves and cheer 
 on their friends.
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/hip-hop-kids/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
