DESCRIPTION:Wednesdays Weekly · 8 Weeks\n\nDate & Time\n\nAugust 5- Septe
 mber 23\, 2026\n\n10:00 AM – 1:00 PM\n\nLocation\n\nRoom 117\, Ceramics 
 Studio\n\nCategory\n\nCeramics\, Extended Classes\n\nExperience Level\n\nA
 ll Levels\n\nAges\n\n17\\+\n\nRegistration Cost:\n\n$265\n\nMaterials Fee:
 \n\n$30\n\nTotal Registration Cost:\n\n$295\n\nIn this session\, we will c
 onsider what makes a set. This will include sets of tumblers\, stacking di
 shes\, bowls\, sugar and creamer sets\, and more. These projects are perfe
 ct for your own home or to give as special gifts. As always\, we will use 
 texture to enhance our work. Ready\, set\, play with clay!\n\nInterested i
 n spending a bit more time in the studio with Lynn Wood?\n\nThis session\,
  opt-in for and additional 1.5 hours of guided working time each class ses
 sion in the studio with Lynn Wood for an extra fee. Regularly scheduled cl
 ass will occur from 10am-1pm\, and then our additional Guided Working Sess
 ion with Lynn Wood will run from 1:30pm-3:00pm
