BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Cuban Salsa
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260903T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260903T203000
UID:260528s5KptLttoUy1ins4i1D_8Q
DESCRIPTION:Cuban Salsa Class with Eric Celestino & Abigail Celestino\n\n4
 week class\n\nSeptember 3 – September 24\n\nClass requires a minimum of 
 8 registrations to run. Please register soon so we can secure the session!
 \n\nThis is a beginner cuban salsa—you will learn your basic footwork an
 d turns.\n\nIn this class\, you will learn the fundamentals of Cuban Salsa
 \, including body movement\, rhythm\, musicality\, footwork\, partner conn
 ection\, and partnerwork patterns inspired by authentic Cuban dance cultur
 e. We focus on proper technique\, coordination\, flow\, and natural body e
 xpression\, while also building confidence and strong foundations.\n\nClas
 ses are structured with:\n\n• Warm-up and body movement\n\n• Footwork 
 and rhythm exercises\n\n• Partnerwork technique\n\n• Short combination
 s and practical applications\n\nOur goal is to help you understand how to 
 dance salsa\, not just memorize steps — developing timing\, connection\,
  and a comfortable\, joyful way of dancing.\n\nCome dance with us\, grow y
 our technique\, and experience the energy and flavor of Cuba in a supporti
 ve and welcoming environment.\n\nBook your spot\n\nDate & Time:\n\n4week c
 lass\, September 3 – September 24\n\nClass requires a minimum of 8 regis
 trations to run. Please register soon so we can secure the session!\n\nThu
 rsdays @ 7:30 PM\n\nAddress: 4140 Redwood Highway \\#8 San Rafael\, CA\n\n
 Note: Arrive 10 minutes before. No floor marking shoe soles allowed.
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/cuban-salsa/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Thursday Night Live at Priest Ranch
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260903T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260903T210000
UID:2605040ECA_ryTbk2c4u6K7-sJ6w
DESCRIPTION:Join us for our annual Thursday Night Live series—an ongoing
  celebration of great music\, good wine\, and easy Napa Valley evenings. T
 hroughout the season\, we’ll feature a rotating lineup of talented local
  and regional artists spanning a variety of genres.\n\nAdmission is compli
 mentary\, and seating is first-come\, first-served—so come early\, grab 
 your spot\, and settle in for the night. Enjoy your favorite Priest Ranch 
 wines available by the glass or bottle\, along with a special menu from Th
 e Kitchen crafted just for the occasion. Whether you’re winding down aft
 er work or gathering friends for a casual night out\, Thursday Night Live 
 is your standing invitation to sip\, savor\, and soak in the sounds.\n\nMu
 sic is complimentary. Wine and food are available to purchase. No reservat
 ion required.\n\nJuly 9 — Carlos Ramirez Trio \\(Latin\\)\n\nJuly 16 —
  David Ronconi Trio \\(Alternative\\)\n\nJuly 23 — Sticky Bandits \\(Cov
 ers\\)\n\nJuly 30 — Complicated Animals \\(Indie Nova\\)\n\nAugust 6 —
  Radio Bobcat \\(Indie\\)\n\nAugust 13 — Big Blu Soul Revue \\(Soul\\)\n
 \nAugust 20 — Lilan Kane \\(Soul\\)\n\nAugust 27 — Sean Carscaden \\(R
 ock\\)\n\nSeptember 10 — Edgardo y Candela \\(Latin\\)\n\nSeptember 17 
 — Steady Eddy & The Shakers \\(Motown\\)
LOCATION:Priest Ranch Tasting Room
URL:https://priestranchwines.com/visit/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Samba no Pé - First Class
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260903T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260903T193000
UID:260415pDYQVFtoUkKAip3cvRM3hg
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to feel the rhythm and energy of Rio de Janeiro! Sa
 mba no Pé \\(Samba in the Foot\\) is the captivating solo style of samba
  danced in the streets and at Carnival\, known for its rapid\, intricate f
 ootwork and infectious hip movements.\n\nYou will learn\n\nThe Basic Step:
  You will master the signature quick-quick-slow rhythm that defines Samba 
 no Pé.\n\nArm & Hip Styling: You will learn how to add the authentic flai
 r\, movement\, and energy that makes Brazilian samba so captivating.\n\nTe
 chnique & Posture: You will receive tips on proper body alignment to help 
 you dance longer\, faster\, and more safely.\n\nRhythm & Musicality: You w
 ill learn how to connect your movement directly to the irresistible beat o
 f the bateria \\(the samba drum section\\).\n\nThis class is perfect for a
 nyone looking to connect with the vibrant spirit of Brazil\, improve coord
 ination\, and get a fantastic workout—all while learning the foundationa
 l steps of this iconic dance. No partner or prior dance experience is requ
 ired! Just bring your enthusiasm and comfortable shoes!\n\nDate & Time: Th
 ursdays @6:30PM – 7:30PM\n\nAddress: 4140 Redwood Highway \\#8 San Rafae
 l\, CA\n\nNote: Arrive 10 minutes before. No floor marking shoe soles allo
 wed.
LOCATION:4140 Redwood Highway #8
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/samba-no-pe
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
